    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Solomoni wakeŋeli ambanda amavulu akwacheŋi nakwacheŋi akulunjika hadi mwana kaFwaro; ambanda awaMowabi, niawaAmori, niawaEdomi, niakuZidoni, niawaHiti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akunyuza yalejeliyi Yehova anyana kaIsarela, nindi, Bayi mwakayapa mukachi kawuku, helawena bayi akenzaŋa mukachi kenuku; mwalala wena akayi balu mwina nyichima yenu yakalondeli akishi awu. Diwu alamatiliyi Solomoni mbenakuyikeŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadipi nawapodi jindi makulakaji atanu nayedi anyanaka wanyanta, antombu jindi makulakaji asatu. Apodi jindi abalumwini muchima windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa cheliliyi Solomoni nakuli dehi, aŋodi jindi hiyakubalu muna muchima windi hiwukulondela akishi; muchima windikuya chikupu kudi Yehova Nzambi yindi neyi chiwelili muchima watatayindi Davidi nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni hakulondela Ashitoreti mukishi wamumbandawawa kwaZidoni, niMilikomi chishimashima chawaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni welili chatama kumesu aYehova, hamulondeli Yehova chikupu neyicheliliyi tata yindi Daviduku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni hakutuŋa chinaŋanaŋa chaKemoshi chishimashima chaMowabi, hampidi yatalaŋana naYerusalema, nichaMoleki chishimashima chawanyana kaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apodi jindi akwacheŋi nakwacheŋi ejima ochelelaŋa akishi awu insensi nakuyiketwila yimuna, wayililili mwomumu nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wazuwili naSolomoni nanochu chabalumukili muchima windihiwukufuma kudi Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela wamumwekeneni kayedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamulejeli chena chumichi chakubula kulondela akishi; yena kwindikuhemba mwamulejeliyi Yehova nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova hakumwila Solomoni nindi, Ichi chiwuneli mwenimu, chiwunabuli kuhemba chitiyaŋenu chami niyidika yami yinakulejeli, ami nakakutabula wanta bwe-chi, nakawinka kambuŋeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa dinu hamujimba watata yeyi Davidi hinakachilaha mafuku eyuku; nakawutabula muchikasa chamwaneyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, hinakatabula wanta wejimaku; mwaneyi nakamwinka muchidi wumuhamujimba wakambuŋami Davidi, nihansaŋu yaYerusalema natondeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamusaŋu mwinini Solomoni chilumbu, kaEdomi Hadadi; wadiŋi wawanyana kamwanta waiukanu wamuEdomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hadiŋiyi Davidi muEdomi, hayiliyi Yowabi mukulumpi wanjita nakuŋika afu, heliliyi natapi dehi amayala amuEdomi ejima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa Yowabi nawaIsarela ejima ashakamini kwenoku tukweji tutanu nakamu, nichajahiliyi amayala amuEdomi ejima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dihu hatemukiliyi Hadadi, niyena niaEdomia makwawu adiŋi ambuŋatata yindi, nawu ayi muEjipitu; henohu Hadadi wuchidi mwana wanyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiya kunyamuka kuMidiyani, hiyakwinza kuParani, hiyakutambula antu amuParani, hiyakuya nawu muEjipitu, kudi mwanta wakuEjipitu Fwaro. Yena hakumwinka itala, hakuleja antukumwinka yakudya, hakumwinka nimpata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadi waweni wuselewa nankashi kudi Fwaro, Fwaro hakumwinkani ishaku dindi mana kwamwadi Tahipenesi, nindi, Sumbulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owumana kwaTahipenesi wamuvweleleli mwanindi Genubati asumwishiliyi Tahipenesi mwitala daFwaro. Genubati washakaminimwitala daFwarohamu nawanyana kaFwaro amayala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadi muEjipitu chatiyiliyi nawu Davidi nakami dehi hamu nawankakulula jindi, niYowabi mukulumpi wanjita nafwi dehi, Hadadi hakumwila Fwaro nindi, Ijiteji niyi kwituŋa detu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fwaro hakumwila nindi, Indikudami wunabuli chumanyi mwaka wukeŋi kuya kwituŋa denwenu aweni? Hakwakula nindi, Hinabuli chumaku; hela chochu, kumina dakuŋituŋa niyikwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wamusaŋu mwinini chilumbu mukwawu nawa, mwana kaEliyada Rezoni, wadiŋi watemuka dehi kudi nkaka yindi mwanta waZoba Hadadezeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wapompesheli antu kudi yena, hatapiliyi Davidi antu yena Rezoni welili mukulumpi wachendu. Hiyakuya nakushakama kuDamakasa, hakwikala mwanta muDamakasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwikalaŋa chilumbu chawaIsarela mafuku aSolomoni ejima, chakulunjika hayuma yatama yeliliyi Hadadi. Wayiheleli aIsarela, welili mwanta wakuSiriya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowami mwana kaNebati, mukwaEfweremi wakuZereda, kambuŋi Solomoni, wukweti mama yindi Zeruwa, ntuluwa, niyena nawawadikaŋili namwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu nsaŋu yadikaŋililiyi namwanta. Hadiŋi nakutupayi Solomoni Milo, hadiŋi nakutuŋululayi mpwembu yamukala watata yindi Davidi mwafwili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owu iyala Yerobowami wadiŋi chilobumukwa Ŋovu. Solomoni chamumweniyi owu mukwenzi wasweja nyidimu, hakumwinka wuawakulumpi wanyidimu yejima yamutaŋa waYosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku owu heliliyi Yerobowami hakufuma kuYerusalema, kaprofwetu Ahiyawa kuShilo hakumuwana munjila. Ahiya wadiŋi wavwala ihina dadiha. Adiŋi kanka wawu mumpata wena ayedi hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiya hakukwata ihinadadiha davweliyi, hakuditabula yibeli ikumi nayiyedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumwila Yerobowami, nindi, Tambulaku yibeli yeyi ikumi; muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela nahoshi nindi, Tala, nakatabula wanta muchikasa chaSolomoni bwe-chi, nakakwinkeyi nyichidi ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wakekala namuchidiwumu hamujimba wakambuŋami Davidi, nansaŋu yaYerusalema, mukalanatondeli munyichidi yawaIsarela yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wena ananleki dehi ami, hiyakudifukula kudi Ashitoreti mukishi wamumbanda wawakwaZidoni, niKemoshi mukishi waMowabi, niMilikomi mukishi wawanyana kaAmoni. Hiyanendi chachiwahi munjila jami nakwila chachiwahi kumesu ami, nakuhemba yidika yami nawuŋaji wami neyi cheliliyi tata yindi Daviduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, hinakatambula wanta wejima kudi yena kulaŋa nukumwinkawukalamba mafuku indi ejima akekalayi wamumi, hamujimbawaka mbuŋami Davidi natondeli, wahembelaŋa kuleja kwami nayidika yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakatambula wanta kudi mwanindi, nakakwinkawu eyi, yoyi nyichidiikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanindi nakamwinka muchidi wumu, kulonda kambuŋi miDavidi akekalaŋa nenoŋu mafuku ejima kumesu ami muYerusalema, wowumukala natondeli kusha ijina dami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakutambula, wakayula mwejima munakeŋi muchima weyi, wakekala mwanta wawaIsarela walukanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi wakatiyilila mwejima munakakuleja, nakwenda munjila jami, nakwila chachiwahi kumesu ami, nakuhemba yidika yami nikuleja kwami, neyi cheliliyi kambuŋami Davidi, ami nakekala neyi, nakakutuŋila mutaŋawa-ngu, neyi chinanamutuŋilili Davidi, nakakwinka aIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakabisha anyana kaDavidi nansaŋu iyi, ilaŋa hichahaya nyakaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
